    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase 3 P3-03-A/B: Unified resource pool orchestrator for ThemisDB. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AdaptiveConnectionPool — pool of generic connection slots with dynamic min/max sizing and acquisition-timeout.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ResourcePoolManager — unified facade over the connection pool, buffer pool (BufferPool), and thread pool (themis::utils::ThreadPoolManager).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Design goals (P3-03 acceptance criteria):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Connection pool: min=5, max=50, scale-up latency &lt; 10 ms.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Leak detection: borrowed resources timed out and reclaimed.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Saturation monitoring: alert threshold at &gt; 80 % utilization.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Unified statistics across all pool types.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Block B P3-03-A/B delivery </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
